Description: 'fugazi.db' is a package of tidy data derived from the Fugazi Live Series and related sources - 
    show listings, venue coordinates, durations, and discographical information.
    - originally sourced from <https://www.dischord.com/fugazi_live_series>
    and other sources. See LICENSE for the copyright status of the underlying data.
